    "user_request_original": "Optimize a 22-layer planar multilayer stack on CaF2 substrate with air incidence. Layer sequence: Si, Al2O3, Si, Al2O3, Si, Al2O3, Si, Al2O3, Si, Al2O3, Si (cavity1), Si, Al2O3, Si, Al2O3, Si, Al2O3, Si (cavity2), Si, Al2O3, Si, Al2O3. Initialize cavity1 thickness at 825 nm (quarter-wave at 3.30 μm in Si), cavity2 at 1062 nm (quarter-wave at 4.25 μm in Si), all other layers at 550 nm. Thickness bounds: 400-1100 nm for all layers. Optimize for maximum mean transmittance in 3250-3350 nm and 4200-4300 nm bands, minimum mean transmittance in 2500-3100 nm and 4450-5000 nm bands. Normal incidence, unpolarized. Use L2 regularization coefficient 0.01 for first 50 iterations. Report best_target_score, valid_candidates, tightest_margin, thicknesses_nm, run_status. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 2500-3100 nm, 3250-3350 nm, 4200-4300 nm, 4450-5000 nm. soft objectives: High transmittance in 3.25-3.35 um and 4.20-4.30 um bands; Low transmittance in 2.50-3.10 um and 4.45-5.00 um bands. behaviors to suppress or avoid: High transmittance in 2.50-3.10 um and 4.45-5.00 um bands. manufacturing constraints: Total layer count <= 24; No metal layers; Conventional depositable infrared inorganic dielectric materials only.",
